{"audio":{"src":"https://pub-13abeb101e2945d2a7f60234f6faf52e.r2.dev/materials/a2-explainer-about-demon-slayer-kimetsu-no-yaiba-what-the-series-is-about-the-main-charact/audio/main-5f2bc470eab4.mp3","durationSec":315.096,"cues":[{"start":0,"end":1.84,"text":"Demon Slayer is a Japanese manga."},{"start":2.44,"end":4.62,"text":"Its Japanese title is Kimetsu no Yaiba."},{"start":5.3,"end":7.6,"text":"The artist and writer is Koyoharu Gotouge."},{"start":8.16,"end":16.7,"text":"The manga ran in the magazine Weekly Shōnen Jump from February 2016 to May 2020, and the full story fills 23 volumes."},{"start":17.64,"end":24.12,"text":"In 2019, the studio Ufotable made an anime, and the anime made the story famous all over the world."},{"start":25.14,"end":27.7,"text":"The story happens in Japan in the Taisho era."},{"start":28.54,"end":38.32,"text":"That is the time from 1912 to 1926, when Japan had trains and electric lights in cities, but many villages in the mountains still lived in the old way."},{"start":39.26,"end":42.32,"text":"In this world, demons hide in the dark and eat people."},{"start":42.9,"end":47.26,"text":"A small group of sword fighters, the Demon Slayer Corps, hunts them at night."},{"start":48.14,"end":50.54,"text":"The story follows one boy who joins this group."},{"start":51.4,"end":53.26,"text":"Tanjiro Kamado is the main character."},{"start":53.68,"end":58.72,"text":"He is a kind, hard-working boy who lives in the mountains with his mother, brothers, and sisters."},{"start":59.36,"end":63.82,"text":"His father is dead, so Tanjiro sells charcoal in the town below to feed the family."},{"start":64.34,"end":67.86,"text":"He has a very strong nose, and he can smell feelings and danger."},{"start":68.48,"end":71.44,"text":"One day he goes to town and stays the night there because of the snow."},{"start":72.12,"end":75.58,"text":"When he comes home the next morning, a demon has killed his whole family."},{"start":76.26,"end":82.24,"text":"Only his younger sister, Nezuko Kamado, is alive, and the demon's blood has turned her into a demon too."},{"start":82.86,"end":86.6,"text":"Most demons attack humans right away, but Nezuko does not."},{"start":87.22,"end":89.26,"text":"She still loves her brother and protects him."},{"start":89.92,"end":92.66,"text":"Tanjiro now has one clear goal for the whole story."},{"start":93.86,"end":96.58,"text":"He wants to find a cure and make Nezuko human again."},{"start":97.4,"end":102.52,"text":"On the same morning, a sword fighter named Giyu Tomioka finds Tanjiro and Nezuko."},{"start":103.04,"end":107.02,"text":"He is a member of the Demon Slayer Corps, and his job is to kill demons."},{"start":107.8,"end":112.4,"text":"He sees that Nezuko protects her brother instead of eating him, so he lets her live."},{"start":113.28,"end":118.04,"text":"He sends Tanjiro to an old teacher, Sakonji Urokodaki, who lives on a mountain."},{"start":118.82,"end":120.56,"text":"Tanjiro trains there for two years."},{"start":121.2,"end":126.36,"text":"He runs down the mountain at night, jumps over traps, and cuts a huge rock with his sword."},{"start":126.98,"end":128.48,"text":"He learns Water Breathing."},{"start":129.14,"end":135.44,"text":"This is a way of breathing and moving that makes a sword fighter strong and fast, and each move looks like flowing water."},{"start":136.12,"end":141.7,"text":"In the end, he passes the Final Selection, a seven-day test on a mountain full of demons."},{"start":142.52,"end":150.48,"text":"He becomes a Demon Slayer, and Nezuko travels with him in a wooden box on his back, because sunlight can kill a demon."},{"start":150.48,"end":152.34,"text":"Tanjiro does not fight alone for long."},{"start":152.72,"end":157.62,"text":"On his first missions, he meets two other young Demon Slayers, and they become his team."},{"start":158.74,"end":163.66,"text":"Zenitsu Agatsuma is a boy with yellow hair who is often afraid and cries a lot."},{"start":164.06,"end":171.06,"text":"But he has very good ears, and when he sleeps, his body fights with Thunder Breathing, a fast style like lightning."},{"start":172.16,"end":174.24,"text":"He also likes Nezuko very much."},{"start":175.08,"end":176.76,"text":"Inosuke Hashibira is very different."},{"start":177.74,"end":182.92,"text":"Wild boars raised him in the mountains, so he wears a boar head as a mask and shouts all the time."},{"start":183.64,"end":186.68,"text":"He fights with two swords and calls his style Beast Breathing."},{"start":187.3,"end":189.34,"text":"He loves to fight and wants to be the strongest."},{"start":190.2,"end":194.84,"text":"The three boys are noisy and often argue, but they help each other in every hard battle."},{"start":195.68,"end":199.48,"text":"They work together, and teamwork becomes a big theme of the story."},{"start":200.22,"end":202.4,"text":"Every demon in the story comes from one person."},{"start":202.4,"end":207.48,"text":"Muzan Kibutsuji is the first demon, and he is more than one thousand years old."},{"start":208.38,"end":213.66,"text":"Long ago, a doctor tried to cure his illness, and the medicine changed him into a demon."},{"start":214.5,"end":217,"text":"Now his blood can turn humans into demons too."},{"start":217,"end":222.02,"text":"Muzan killed Tanjiro's family, so he is also Tanjiro's personal enemy."},{"start":222.02,"end":227.56,"text":"Demons are strong, they heal fast, and they eat humans to grow stronger."},{"start":227.96,"end":232.52,"text":"But they cannot go into sunlight, and a special sword to the neck can kill them."},{"start":232.52,"end":234.82,"text":"Muzan hates the sun."},{"start":235.54,"end":238.84,"text":"His dream is to become a perfect being who can walk in the day."},{"start":239.64,"end":247.12,"text":"He hides in cities, sometimes looking like a rich man with a family, and he sends his twelve strongest demons to fight for him."},{"start":248,"end":251.26,"text":"The Demon Slayer Corps has hunted him for a very long time."},{"start":251.92,"end":259,"text":"Tanjiro also meets Tamayo, a demon doctor who does not eat humans, and she agrees to help him look for Nezuko's cure."},{"start":260.26,"end":261.62,"text":"Tanjiro's road is long."},{"start":262.32,"end":265.38,"text":"He and his friends fight many strong demons on their missions."},{"start":266.34,"end":267.44,"text":"Some demons are lonely."},{"start":268.12,"end":268.86,"text":"Some are cruel."},{"start":269.78,"end":274.38,"text":"Each fight teaches Tanjiro something new about breathing, swords, and people."},{"start":275.1,"end":277.38,"text":"Above the normal Demon Slayers stand the Hashira."},{"start":278.02,"end":284.34,"text":"The Hashira are the strongest sword fighters in the Demon Slayer Corps, and each one has a special breathing style."},{"start":284.9,"end":289.72,"text":"Tanjiro meets several of them as the story goes on, and he learns how hard their job is."},{"start":290.42,"end":293.02,"text":"Through every battle, Tanjiro keeps two goals."},{"start":293.5,"end":299.3,"text":"He wants to make Nezuko human again, and he wants to stop Muzan Kibutsuji so demons stop hurting families."},{"start":300.28,"end":301.96,"text":"The story is not only about fighting."},{"start":302.3,"end":307.76,"text":"It is also about kindness, family, and friends who stay together when the night is long."},{"start":308.22,"end":314.5,"text":"That is why so many readers and viewers care about Tanjiro, Nezuko, Zenitsu, and Inosuke."}],"words":[{"text":"Demon","start":0,"end":0.32},{"text":"Slayer","start":0.32,"end":0.68},{"text":"is","start":0.68,"end":0.98},{"text":"a","start":0.98,"end":1.12},{"text":"Japanese","start":1.12,"end":1.56},{"text":"manga","start":1.56,"end":1.84},{"text":"Its","start":2.44,"end":2.56},{"text":"Japanese","start":2.56,"end":2.98},{"text":"title","start":2.98,"end":3.36},{"text":"is","start":3.36,"end":3.62},{"text":"Kimetsu","start":3.62,"end":4.08},{"text":"no","start":4.08,"end":4.28},{"text":"Yaiba","s